"""
start = 18.965
duration = 6.875

[[scene]]
file = "scene-26.wav"

[[scene.caption]]
text = """\
The engineering approach connects decisions to implementation and \
verification.\
"""
start = 0
duration = 5.975

[[scene.caption]]
text = """\
Capability boundaries make ownership clear, while the Essentials and test \
harnesses exercise behavior and expose evidence.\
"""
start = 6.155
duration = 9.025

[[scene.caption]]
text = """\
For the project team, progress means a demonstrated flow and reproducible \
results, alongside the design.\
"""
start = 15.36
duration = 8.2

